        "title": "自定义 SkipMLP",
        "source": "from torch import nn\n\nclass SkipMLP(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, width=32):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.proj = nn.Linear(width, width)\n    def forward(self, x):\n        return x + self.proj(x)\n",
